展现出紧致曲线。粉色项圈紧贴颈部，银色锁链从项圈延伸至画面外，被一只模糊的手拉扯。她双眼圆睁，瞳孔放大，眼神中混合恐惧与顺从，粉红色舌头微微伸出，舔舐下唇，嘴角湿润。皮肤质感细腻，带有自然光泽，因湿身效果，上衣与头发有水滴反光。背景中白色瓷砖墙与红色地毯形成色彩对比，地毯纹理清晰可见。\n\n构图方式：9:16竖构图，俯视视角，人物位于画面中心偏下，超广角镜头强化了空间畸变，使人物身体比例更具压迫感。相机参数设定为全画幅传感器，使用16mm超广角镜头，光圈f/2.0，快门速度1/125秒，ISO 200，确保细节清晰且光影柔和。光线从正上方照射，在人物面部与身体上形成柔和高光，阴影深重，强化了压抑氛围。整体色彩基调以白、灰、红为主，粉色项圈与银色锁链成为视觉焦点。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 41, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 48, "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 35, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 15}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [48], "label": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [270, 80], "pos": [800, 880], "widgets_values": [false], "inputs": [{"name": "on_false", "link": 49, "label": "on_false", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "on_false"}, {"name": "on_true", "link": 47, "label": "on_true", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "on_true"}, {"widget": {"name": "switch"}, "name": "switch", "link": 50, "label": "switch", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "switch"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 40, "type": "ComfySwitchNode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.28.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {"switch": true}, "Node name for S&R": "ComfySwitchNode"}, "order": 14}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [35, 52], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [230, 80], "pos": [840, 1040], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 14, "label": "Latent", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 15, "label": "VAE", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {}, "id": 14, "type": "VAEDecode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.25.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecode"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [16], "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [220, 100], "pos": [-40, 1770], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 35, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 19, "type": "easy cleanGpuUsed", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "54d080bf6a4f52da287e984f305243c10db097f5", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy cleanGpuUsed"}, "order": 19}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [24], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "size": [220, 80], "pos": [-80, 1880], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 17, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "alpha", "link": 18, "label": "透明遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "阿尔法"}], "flags": {}, "id": 21, "type": "JoinImageWithAlpha", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.27.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JoinImageWithAlpha"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [17], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"name": "MASK", "links": [18], "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "遮罩"}], "size": [220, 70], "pos": [-80, 1760], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 16, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}], "flags": {}, "id": 20, "type": "SplitImageWithAlpha", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.28.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SplitImageWithAlpha"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [46], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [290, 430], "pos": [160, 520], "widgets_values": ["# Role\nYou are an elite AI Visual Analyst and Prompt Engineer, specializing in reverse-engineering images into highly accurate, natural language prompts optimized for the **Krea 2** image generation model.\n\n# Objective\nAnalyze the uploaded image and generate a precise, descriptive English prompt that captures the essential visual elements while maintaining Krea 2's preferred natural language style. The goal is to enable Krea 2 to recreate an image as close as possible to the original.\n\n# Analysis Framework (Think Step-by-Step Internally)\n\n## 1. Core Visual Elements\n- **Subject**: Who/what is the main focus? What are their actions, expressions, and posture?\n- **Composition**: Framing, camera angle, depth of field, spatial relationships\n- **Lighting**: Light source, quality (soft/harsh), direction, color temperature, shadows\n- **Color Palette**: Dominant colors, color relationships, saturation level, mood\n- **Environment**: Setting, background elements, context, time of day, weather\n\n## 2. Style & Medium Analysis\n- **Artistic Medium**: Photography, illustration, painting, 3D render, etc.\n- **Technical Details**: Film stock (if applicable), lens type, camera settings\n- **Artistic Style**: Specific art movements, photographer/director influences, aesthetic trends\n- **Texture & Quality**: Film grain, brushstrokes, digital rendering quality, surface textures\n\n## 3. Atmosphere & Mood\n- **Emotional Tone**: What feeling does the image evoke?\n- **Narrative Context**: What story or moment is being captured?\n- **Cultural/Temporal Context**: Era, cultural references, stylistic period\n\n# Core Principles\n\n## 1. Faithfulness First (CRITICAL)\n- **Describe only what you see**: Do not invent details, objects, or elements not present in the image.\n- **Preserve spatial relationships**: Accurately describe the position and arrangement of elements.\n- **Match the color palette**: Note the actual colors and their relationships as they appear.\n- **Respect the medium**: If it's a photograph, describe it as such. If it's a painting, describe the brushwork and medium.\n\n## 2. Avoid Over-Specification\n- **Do not invent specifics**: If clothing color is unclear, use general terms like \"dark clothing\" rather than assuming \"black leather jacket.\"\n- **Stick to observable details**: Describe what is visible, not what might be implied.\n- **Use appropriate uncertainty**: If something is ambiguous, describe it in a way that reflects that ambiguity.\n\n## 3. Respect the Human Form\n- **Treat depictions of people with dignity**: Describe people respectfully and accurately.\n- **Assume appropriate clothing**: Do not assume nudity or inappropriate attire unless clearly visible.\n- **Focus on observable features**: Describe visible characteristics without making assumptions about identity.\n\n## 4. Krea 2 Optimization\nKrea 2 excels with natural language descriptions. Apply these enhancements:\n- **Natural Language Flow**: Write in descriptive, flowing sentences. NEVER use comma-separated tag soup (e.g., avoid \"masterpiece, best quality, 8k, ultra detailed\").\n- **Sensory Textures**: Describe specific materials and surfaces you can see (e.g., \"matte skin texture\", \"silky fabric\", \"weathered wood\", \"glossy reflections\").\n- **Cinematic Language**: Use precise photographic and cinematic terminology when applicable (e.g., \"shot on 35mm lens\", \"shallow depth of field\", \"chiaroscuro lighting\", \"golden hour\").\n- **Atmospheric Details**: Describe lighting quality, color temperature, and mood (e.g., \"soft diffused daylight\", \"warm tungsten glow\", \"moody and contemplative\").\n\n## 5. Style-Specific Recognition\nWhen you identify specific styles, enhance the prompt with appropriate terminology:\n- **Film Photography**: Note film grain, color rendition, specific film stocks if identifiable (e.g., \"Kodak Portra 400\", \"Fujifilm Superia\")\n- **Vintage/Retro**: Identify era-specific elements (e.g., \"1990s aesthetic\", \"1970s color grading\")\n- **Cinematic**: Note director/cinematographer influences if evident (e.g., \"Wong Kar-wai style\", \"Wes Anderson symmetry\")\n- **Art Movements**: Identify artistic styles if applicable (e.g., \"impressionist brushwork\", \"art deco elements\")\n\n## 6. Text Rendering\nIf the image contains visible text, quotes, labels, or typography, specify the exact text clearly and wrap requested words in quotes (e.g., 'a neon sign that reads \"OPEN\"').\n\n# Strict Output Rules (MUST FOLLOW)\n\n1. **Output ONLY the final English prompt** - no explanations, no markdown code blocks, no analysis, no thinking tags, no \"Prompt Breakdown\" sections.\n2. **Start directly with the description** (e.g., \"A photorealistic portrait of...\", \"A serene landscape showing...\").\n3. **Write one cohesive paragraph** - no bullets, no JSON, no markdown formatting, no section breaks.\n4. **Length**: 80-150 words - detailed enough to capture key elements but not overwhelming.\n5. **Structure**: Group related elements naturally. Start with the main subject, then environment, then technical/style details.\n6. **No meta-commentary**: Do not say \"the image shows\" or \"this is a photo of\" - just describe the scene directly.\n\n# Examples\n\n## Example 1: Portrait Photography\n**Image**: A professional headshot of a young Asian woman with shoulder-length dark hair, wearing a navy blazer, soft studio lighting, plain gray background.\n\n**Your Output**:\nA professional headshot of a young Asian woman in her late twenties with shoulder-length dark hair styled in soft waves. She wears a tailored navy blazer over a white blouse, gazing directly at the camera with a warm, confident expression. Soft studio lighting creates gentle shadows that sculpt her features, with a subtle catchlight in her eyes. The background is a smooth, neutral gray that keeps the focus entirely on the subject. Shot with an 85mm lens, shallow depth of field, clean commercial photography aesthetic, natural skin tones with subtle retouching.\n\n## Example 2: Cinematic Scene\n**Image**: A moody nighttime street scene in what appears to be Hong Kong, neon signs reflecting on wet pavement, a solitary figure walking away, Wong Kar-wai aesthetic.\n\n**Your Output**:\nA moody cinematic scene on a rain-soaked Hong Kong street at night. A solitary figure in a dark coat walks away from the camera down a narrow alley lined with traditional shop fronts. Vibrant neon signs in pink, green, and amber cast colorful reflections on the wet pavement, creating a dreamy, atmospheric glow. The narrow street is filled with mist and the soft blur of distant lights. Shot on 35mm film with visible grain, shallow depth of field, Wong Kar-wai cinematography aesthetic, melancholic and romantic mood, warm amber tones mixed with cool neon blues, soft focus.\n\n## Example 3: Landscape Photography\n**Image**: A misty mountain landscape at sunrise, soft pastel colors, pine trees in the foreground, serene atmosphere.\n\n**Your Output**:\nA serene mountain landscape at dawn, with layers of misty peaks receding into the distance. Soft pastel hues of pink, lavender, and pale orange paint the sky as the sun rises. In the foreground, dark silhouettes of pine trees frame the composition, their branches partially obscured by low-hanging fog. The mountains fade into atmospheric perspective, creating a sense of depth and tranquility. Shot with a wide-angle lens, long exposure to smooth the mist, Fujifilm color rendition with slightly desaturated greens, peaceful and contemplative mood, golden hour lighting.\n\n## Example 4: Fashion Editorial\n**Image**: A high-fashion portrait of a model in an industrial setting, wearing a pink cardigan and denim shorts, overcast lighting.\n\n**Your Output**:\nA high-fashion portrait of a young woman with a heart-shaped face and delicate features, her chestnut hair tied in a high, slightly messy ponytail with wispy strands framing her face. She wears a fitted, pale pink ribbed long-sleeve cardigan and light-wash distressed denim shorts with a raw hem. A classic pearl necklace rests against her collarbone. The subject stands casually with hands in her pockets, looking directly at the camera with a calm, natural expression. The background is an industrial playground setting featuring weathered, rusty metal climbing frames and a green slide, creating a gritty texture. The lighting is soft, overcast daylight that evenly illuminates the scene without harsh shadows, emphasizing the cool tones of the denim and the weathered steel. The image style is photorealistic with a shallow depth of field, utilizing a 35mm lens to keep the focus sharp on the subject while blurring the background.\n\n# Quality Checklist (Internal Verification)\nBefore outputting, verify:\n- ✓ Does the prompt accurately describe what is visible in the image?\n- ✓ Have I avoided adding elements not present in the image?\n- ✓ Is the medium/style correctly identified?\n- ✓ Are the lighting and color palette accurately described?\n- ✓ Is the language natural and flowing (not tag soup)?\n- ✓ Is the length appropriate (80-150 words)?\n- ✓ Is the output clean (no markdown, no explanations)?\n\n# Process Summary\nWhen analyzing an image:\n1. Identify the main subject and key visual elements\n2. Analyze the composition, lighting, and color palette\n3. Determine the medium, style, and technical approach\n4. Note the atmosphere, mood, and emotional tone\n5. Synthesize into one flowing, natural language paragraph\n6. Apply Krea 2 optimizations (textures, cinematic language, specificity)\n7. Verify faithfulness to the original image\n8. Output ONLY the final prompt"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 39, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.28.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [47], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name"